{"seq":2,"slug":"ad-claim-brand-compliance","title":"广告宣称/品牌合规校验","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketing-creative-dam-aigc-production/creative-approval-flow/ad-claim-brand-compliance","wordCount":2383,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"广告宣称-品牌合规校验\">广告宣称/品牌合规校验</h1><p>&quot;销量第一&quot;&quot;最低价&quot;&quot;纯天然&quot;&quot;医生推荐&quot;——这类表述在广告里出现的频率和它们的法律风险成正比。合规校验的工程挑战不在于判断某句话是否违规（那是法务与规则库的事），而在于<strong>在正确的节点、用正确的规则版本、拿到正确的证据</strong>去做出判断，并且让这个判断可追溯、可复现、可随规则变更而失效重审。这一节讲这条校验链路如何在工程上落地；具体的法规判定标准以 <code>119_marketing-claim-promo-compliance</code> 为权威。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-宣称的分类与证据绑定\">核心概念：宣称的分类与证据绑定</h2><p>合规校验的第一性问题是&quot;这句话属于哪一类宣称&quot;。分类决定了它需要什么证据、在哪些市场受限、由谁签。不分类而直接做关键词匹配，会产生大量误报和漏报。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  C[&quot;创意文案文本&quot;] --&gt; EX[&quot;宣称抽取&lt;br/&gt;规则 + 模型&quot;]&#10;  EX --&gt; CL[&quot;分类器&quot;]&#10;  CL --&gt; T1[&quot;事实性宣称&lt;br/&gt;可量化 · 需证据&quot;]&#10;  CL --&gt; T2[&quot;比较性宣称&lt;br/&gt;需比较基准&quot;]&#10;  CL --&gt; T3[&quot;绝对化宣称&lt;br/&gt;最高级 · 多数市场受限&quot;]&#10;  CL --&gt; T4[&quot;功效/健康宣称&lt;br/&gt;需科学证据&quot;]&#10;  CL --&gt; T5[&quot;主观感受&lt;br/&gt;无需证据&quot;]&#10;  T1 --&gt; EV[&quot;证据绑定校验&quot;]&#10;  T2 --&gt; EV&#10;  T3 --&gt; EV&#10;  T4 --&gt; EV&#10;  T5 --&gt; PASS[&quot;通过&quot;]&#10;  EV --&gt;|证据齐备| PASS&#10;  EV --&gt;|证据缺失| BLOCK[&quot;阻塞审批&lt;br/&gt;请求补证&quot;]\">graph TD\n  C[\"创意文案文本\"] --&gt; EX[\"宣称抽取&lt;br/&gt;规则 + 模型\"]\n  EX --&gt; CL[\"分类器\"]\n  CL --&gt; T1[\"事实性宣称&lt;br/&gt;可量化 · 需证据\"]\n  CL --&gt; T2[\"比较性宣称&lt;br/&gt;需比较基准\"]\n  CL --&gt; T3[\"绝对化宣称&lt;br/&gt;最高级 · 多数市场受限\"]\n  CL --&gt; T4[\"功效/健康宣称&lt;br/&gt;需科学证据\"]\n  CL --&gt; T5[\"主观感受&lt;br/&gt;无需证据\"]\n  T1 --&gt; EV[\"证据绑定校验\"]\n  T2 --&gt; EV\n  T3 --&gt; EV\n  T4 --&gt; EV\n  T5 --&gt; PASS[\"通过\"]\n  EV --&gt;|证据齐备| PASS\n  EV --&gt;|证据缺失| BLOCK[\"阻塞审批&lt;br/&gt;请求补证\"]</pre><p>五类里真正需要工程投入的是&quot;如何自动分类&quot;与&quot;证据如何绑定&quot;。</p>\n<h3 id=\"分类的可操作判据\">分类的可操作判据</h3><p>分类不追求完美，追求的是把大部分明显无需证据的表述（主观感受、纯描述）快速放过，把有风险的表述稳定地送进证据校验。判据可以做成规则优先、模型兜底的混合策略。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类别</th>\n<th>触发特征</th>\n<th>需要的证据类型</th>\n<th>证据有效期要求</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>事实性</td>\n<td>含数字、含&quot;经测试/验证&quot;、含具体参数</td>\n<td>测试报告、统计数据出处</td>\n<td>通常 12–24 个月</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>比较性</td>\n<td>含&quot;比…更好/更快/更便宜&quot;、含&quot;同类最佳&quot;</td>\n<td>比较基准定义、样本与口径</td>\n<td>随基准数据更新</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>绝对化</td>\n<td>含&quot;最&quot;&quot;第一&quot;&quot;唯一&quot;&quot;100%&quot;</td>\n<td>权威排名或统计的当期证明</td>\n<td>短期，随排名更新</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>功效/健康</td>\n<td>含身体、健康、疗效、成分功效词</td>\n<td>科学证据（试验/研究）</td>\n<td>依证据本身有效性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主观感受</td>\n<td>含&quot;美味&quot;&quot;舒适&quot;&quot;好看&quot;等体验词且无可量化断言</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>绝对化宣称在多个市场属于默认受限——欧洲多国、中国等司法辖区对&quot;最&quot;类表述有明确的限制。工程上应当把&quot;绝对化&quot;设为默认拒绝、白名单放行，而不是默认允许、黑名单拦截。默认方向的选择是安全策略问题，选错方向意味着系统在规则库没及时更新时主动放行违规内容。</p>\n<h3 id=\"证据绑定的数据结构\">证据绑定的数据结构</h3><p>证据不是一段说明文字，而是有出处、有有效期、有适用范围的实体。把证据做成实体，才能自动判断&quot;这条证据还能不能支撑这条宣称&quot;。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE claim (&#10;  claim_id     bigserial PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  version_id   bigint NOT NULL REFERENCES asset_version(version_id),&#10;  locale       text NOT NULL,&#10;  text_span    jsonb NOT NULL,&#10;  claim_class  text NOT NULL CHECK (claim_class IN&#10;                 (&#39;factual&#39;,&#39;comparative&#39;,&#39;superlative&#39;,&#39;efficacy&#39;,&#39;subjective&#39;)),&#10;  normalized   text NOT NULL,&#10;  detected_by  text NOT NULL CHECK (detected_by IN (&#39;rule&#39;,&#39;model&#39;,&#39;human&#39;)),&#10;  confidence   numeric(3,2),&#10;  created_at   timestamptz NOT NULL DEFAULT now()&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE claim_evidence (&#10;  evidence_id   bigserial PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  claim_id      bigint NOT NULL REFERENCES claim(claim_id),&#10;  evidence_type text NOT NULL,&#10;  source_ref    text NOT NULL,&#10;  markets       text[] NOT NULL,&#10;  valid_from    date NOT NULL,&#10;  valid_until   date,&#10;  verified_by   bigint,&#10;  verified_at   timestamptz,&#10;  status        text NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;pending&#39;&#10;                  CHECK (status IN (&#39;pending&#39;,&#39;verified&#39;,&#39;expired&#39;,&#39;rejected&#39;))&#10;);&#10;CREATE INDEX evidence_supporting ON claim_evidence (claim_id, status);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> claim</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  claim_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigserial</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  version_id   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> asset_version(version_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  locale       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  text_span    jsonb </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  claim_class  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (claim_class </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                 (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'factual'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'comparative'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'superlative'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'efficacy'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'subjective'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  normalized   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  detected_by  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (detected_by </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'rule'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'model'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'human'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  confidence   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  created_at   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">timestamptz</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> claim_evidence</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  evidence_id   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigserial</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  claim_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> claim(claim_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  evidence_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  source_ref    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  markets       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  valid_from    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  valid_until   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  verified_by   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  verified_at   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">timestamptz</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'pending'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                  CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'pending'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'verified'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'expired'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'rejected'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> evidence_supporting</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> claim_evidence (claim_id, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">status</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>text_span</code> 记录宣称在文案中的位置（起止偏移），这一列是审校界面能定位到具体文字的前提，也是文案被修改后精确判断&quot;哪些宣称受影响&quot;的依据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"校验的执行时机\">校验的执行时机</h2><p>校验有三个可能的位置，各有取舍，实践中应当同时用其中两个：</p>\n<p><strong>生成后立即校验（前置）。</strong> 在审校环节就对生成文案跑一次宣称抽取与证据检查，缺证据的立即打回，避免把注定被拒的素材送到法务面前。这一层的成本最低，收益最大——它节省的是审批人的时间。</p>\n<p><strong>审批时校验（闸门）。</strong> 审批提交时重新跑一次，用审批实例的规则快照（见 <a href=\"creative-review-approval-workflow\">创意审批工作流与角色</a>）。这一层是真正的拦截点，因为它绑定了责任与规则版本。</p>\n<p><strong>分发前校验（兜底）。</strong> 素材推送到渠道前的最后一次检查，主要防的是&quot;审批通过之后素材被改动&quot;与&quot;证据在审批后过期&quot;。这一层查询便宜（只查状态与有效期），但不可省略。</p>\n<p>三层的关系是漏斗而不是冗余：前置层过滤掉大部分明显问题，闸门层做正式判定，兜底层防止时间造成的失效。任何一层被省略都会在另一个地方产生代价——省略前置会让审批人疲惫，省略兜底会让过期证据的素材继续投放。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规则引擎与规则版本\">规则引擎与规则版本</h2><p>校验逻辑必须与规则数据分离。规则是数据（禁用词表、必需证据映射、市场限制矩阵），引擎是代码。规则更新不应该需要发版。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;ruleSetId&quot;: &quot;eu-de&quot;,&#10;  &quot;version&quot;: 14,&#10;  &quot;effectiveFrom&quot;: &quot;2026-03-01&quot;,&#10;  &quot;superlativePolicy&quot;: &quot;deny-by-default&quot;,&#10;  &quot;allowedSuperlatives&quot;: [{ &quot;term&quot;: &quot;Testsieger&quot;, &quot;requires&quot;: &quot;current_award_certificate&quot;, &quot;maxAgeDays&quot;: 400 }],&#10;  &quot;forbiddenPatterns&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;pattern&quot;: &quot;(?i)heilend|heilt\\\\b&quot;, &quot;class&quot;: &quot;efficacy&quot;, &quot;action&quot;: &quot;block&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;pattern&quot;: &quot;(?i)100\\\\s*%\\\\s*(wirksam|sicher)&quot;, &quot;class&quot;: &quot;superlative&quot;, &quot;action&quot;: &quot;block&quot; }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;evidenceRequired&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;comparative&quot;: [&quot;comparison_basis&quot;, &quot;sample_methodology&quot;],&#10;    &quot;efficacy&quot;: [&quot;scientific_study&quot;],&#10;    &quot;superlative&quot;: [&quot;award_or_ranking&quot;]&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;market&quot;: &quot;DE&quot;,&#10;  &quot;locale&quot;: &quot;de-DE&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"ruleSetId\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"eu-de\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"effectiveFrom\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-03-01\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"superlativePolicy\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"deny-by-default\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"allowedSuperlatives\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [{ </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"term\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Testsieger\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"requires\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"current_award_certificate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"maxAgeDays\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">400</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"forbiddenPatterns\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"pattern\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"(?i)heilend|heilt</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\\</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">b\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"class\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"efficacy\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"block\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"pattern\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"(?i)100</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\\</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">s*%</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\\</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">s*(wirksam|sicher)\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"class\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"superlative\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"block\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"evidenceRequired\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"comparative\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"comparison_basis\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sample_methodology\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"efficacy\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"scientific_study\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"superlative\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"award_or_ranking\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"market\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"DE\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"locale\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"de-DE\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>version</code> 与 <code>effectiveFrom</code> 是必备字段：审批实例记录它用的是哪一版（<code>claim_rule_hash</code>），规则更新后可以精确查出生效日之后仍引用旧规则的实例并触发重审。</p>\n<h3 id=\"规则数据的版本存储\">规则数据的版本存储</h3><p>规则快照要求历史版本可被重新加载（否则重审无法复现当时的判定），因此规则表必须保留全部历史版本而不是覆盖更新：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE claim_rule_set (&#10;  rule_set_id  text NOT NULL,&#10;  version      int  NOT NULL,&#10;  effective_from date NOT NULL,&#10;  effective_to   date,&#10;  payload      jsonb NOT NULL,&#10;  payload_hash text  NOT NULL,&#10;  created_at   timestamptz NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (rule_set_id, version),&#10;  EXCLUDE USING gist (rule_set_id WITH =,&#10;                      daterange(effective_from, effective_to, &#39;[)&#39;) WITH &amp;&amp;)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> claim_rule_set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rule_set_id  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      int</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  effective_from </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  effective_to   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  payload      jsonb </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  payload_hash </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  created_at   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">timestamptz</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (rule_set_id, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  EXCLUDE </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">USING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gist (rule_set_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                      daterange(effective_from, effective_to, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'[)'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x26;&#x26;)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>EXCLUDE</code> 约束保证同一规则集的生效区间不重叠——没有它，两条同时生效的规则会让判定结果依赖查询顺序。<code>payload_hash</code> 与审批实例里的 <code>claim_rule_hash</code> 对应，是连接&quot;这次审批依据了什么&quot;与&quot;那份规则现在还在不在&quot;的钥匙。</p>\n<h3 id=\"规则的热更新与灰度\">规则的热更新与灰度</h3><p>规则更新不能全量立即生效。一条新规则如果误报率高，全量生效会让大批已通过审批的素材被重新标记，制造大量无效工单。做法是把新规则先以 <code>shadow</code> 模式运行：命中时只记录不拦截，统计一段时间内的命中量与人工复核的确认率，确认准确率达标后切换为 <code>enforce</code>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE rule_evaluation (&#10;  eval_id      bigserial PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  rule_set_id  text NOT NULL,&#10;  rule_version int  NOT NULL,&#10;  rule_id      text NOT NULL,&#10;  mode         text NOT NULL CHECK (mode IN (&#39;shadow&#39;,&#39;enforce&#39;)),&#10;  claim_id     bigint,&#10;  version_id   bigint NOT NULL,&#10;  matched      boolean NOT NULL,&#10;  human_verdict text CHECK (human_verdict IN (&#39;confirmed&#39;,&#39;false_positive&#39;)),&#10;  created_at   timestamptz NOT NULL DEFAULT now()&#10;);&#10;CREATE INDEX rule_eval_shadow ON rule_evaluation (rule_id, human_verdict)&#10;  WHERE mode = &#39;shadow&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> rule_evaluation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  eval_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigserial</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rule_set_id  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rule_version </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rule_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  mode         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (mode </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'shadow'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'enforce'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  claim_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  version_id   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  matched</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      boolean</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  human_verdict </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (human_verdict </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'confirmed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'false_positive'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  created_at   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">timestamptz</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> rule_eval_shadow</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rule_evaluation (rule_id, human_verdict)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mode </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'shadow'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这张表的 <code>human_verdict</code> 就是规则质量的度量——<code>confirmed / (confirmed + false_positive)</code> 是规则的精确率。低于阈值的规则不允许切到 <code>enforce</code>。这把&quot;规则治理&quot;从一个拍板决策变成了一个有数据支撑的流程。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跨市场的差异化处理\">跨市场的差异化处理</h2><p>同一个宣称在不同市场的处理可能完全相反。校验引擎必须以（宣称，市场）为判定单元，而不是以宣称本身。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>宣称示例</th>\n<th>市场</th>\n<th>处理</th>\n<th>依据</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>&quot;最低价&quot;</td>\n<td>多数欧盟市场</td>\n<td>需比较基准与当期证明</td>\n<td>比较广告须可验证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&quot;销量第一&quot;</td>\n<td>需权威排名当期证明</td>\n<td>绝对化默认拒绝</td>\n<td>最高级表述受限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>健康/功效类表述</td>\n<td>需科学证据</td>\n<td>高门槛</td>\n<td>一般要求可靠科学证据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主观体验表述</td>\n<td>一般市场</td>\n<td>无需证据</td>\n<td>非客观断言</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这里给出的处理方向是工程上的保守默认值，不构成法规意见——具体判据、禁用词法学与所需证据形式以 <code>119_marketing-claim-promo-compliance</code> 的规则库与法务确认为准。本节关心的是系统以什么数据结构去表达这些差异化规则，以及规则变更时如何让历史审批自动失效重审。</p>\n<p>美国市场的证据要求可以用 FTC 的表述作为对齐参照：广告主在广告发布时就必须已经拥有&quot;合理依据&quot;（reasonable basis），证据水平要与宣称本身相称，健康或安全类宣称通常需要&quot;合格且可靠的科学证据&quot;，而消费者推荐必须反映典型结果，或清楚说明大多数人可以预期什么 <a href=\"https://www.ftc.gov/business-guidance/resources/advertising-faqs-guide-small-business\">FTC Advertising FAQs</a>。&quot;典型结果&quot;这一条对 AIGC 场景尤其重要——如果生成的证言式文案暗示了某种普遍效果，就必须能给出典型性说明。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与内容真实性标记的联动\">与内容真实性标记的联动</h2><p>含 AI 生成成分的素材在部分市场有额外的披露要求。欧盟 AI 法案第 50 条要求生成合成音频、图像、视频或文本的 AI 系统提供方以机器可读格式标记输出、使其可被检测为人工生成或操纵，该义务自 2026 年 8 月 2 日起适用；对深度伪造内容，部署方必须作出披露 <a href=\"https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/50/\">EU AI Act Article 50</a>。</p>\n<p>这条要求在校验链路上的落点是：当素材的 <code>content_source_type</code> 为 <code>trainedAlgorithmicMedia</code> 或 <code>compositeWithTrainedAlgorithmicMedia</code>（取值定义见 <a href=\"https://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/digitalsourcetype/\">IPTC Digital Source Type</a>）且目标市场属于要求披露的辖区时，校验必须检查素材是否携带了机器可读的来源标记（如内容凭证），未携带则视为不合规。这把合规校验从&quot;只看文案&quot;扩展到了&quot;也看素材的元数据&quot;，是 2026 年之后新增的必要维度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>宣称先分类再校验：事实性、比较性、绝对化、功效、主观感受五类，证据要求各不相同。</li>\n<li>绝对化宣称采用默认拒绝加白名单，安全策略的方向选错会在规则滞后时主动放行。</li>\n<li>证据是实体：有出处、有效期、适用市场与核验状态，才能自动判断能否支撑宣称。</li>\n<li>三层校验：生成后前置、审批时闸门、分发前兜底，各自解决不同问题，缺一不可。</li>\n<li>规则是数据不是代码，带版本与生效日，审批实例记录规则哈希以支持精确重审。</li>\n<li>新规则先 shadow 观测精确率，达标再 enforce，规则治理有数据支撑。</li>\n<li>判定单元是（宣称，市场），同一表述在不同市场结论可能相反。</li>\n<li>含 AI 生成成分的素材需检查机器可读披露，这是 2026 年后的新增校验维度。</li>\n<li>审批结构见 <a href=\"creative-review-approval-workflow\">创意审批工作流与角色</a>；校验通过后的推送见 <a href=\"asset-publish-channel-distribute\">审批后多渠道分发</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"广告宣称/品牌合规校验","id":"广告宣称-品牌合规校验"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：宣称的分类与证据绑定","id":"核心概念-宣称的分类与证据绑定"},{"level":3,"text":"分类的可操作判据","id":"分类的可操作判据"},{"level":3,"text":"证据绑定的数据结构","id":"证据绑定的数据结构"},{"level":2,"text":"校验的执行时机","id":"校验的执行时机"},{"level":2,"text":"规则引擎与规则版本","id":"规则引擎与规则版本"},{"level":3,"text":"规则数据的版本存储","id":"规则数据的版本存储"},{"level":3,"text":"规则的热更新与灰度","id":"规则的热更新与灰度"},{"level":2,"text":"跨市场的差异化处理","id":"跨市场的差异化处理"},{"level":2,"text":"与内容真实性标记的联动","id":"与内容真实性标记的联动"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"创意审批工作流与角色","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketing-creative-dam-aigc-production/creative-approval-flow/creative-review-approval-workflow"},"next":{"title":"审批后多渠道分发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketing-creative-dam-aigc-production/creative-approval-flow/asset-publish-channel-distribute"}}